{
 "schema": "sceliph.llm-correction-tasks/0.1",
 "registeredAt": "2026-10-26",
 "guide": "You write Sceliph AssemblyIR JSON. Output exactly one JSON object and nothing else.\nFormat: {\"schema\":\"morphloom.assembly/0.1\",\"name\":string,\"units\":\"mm\",\"components\":[component,...]}\ncomponent: {\"id\":string,\"name\":string,\"category\":one of \"enclosure\",\"display\",\"logic\",\"power\",\"camera\",\"audio\",\"radio\",\"mechanical\",\"interconnect\",\"materialName\":string,\"detail\":string,\"geometry\":geometry,\"position\":[x,y,z] (optional, mm, centre of the part),\"rotation\":[rx,ry,rz] (optional, radians, XYZ Euler),\"material\":{\"color\":\"#rrggbb\",\"roughness\":0..1 (optional),\"metalness\":0..1 (optional)}}\nWorld: millimetres, Y is up, the floor is y = 0. Each geometry is centred on the component position.\ngeometry options:\n- {\"op\":\"roundedBox\",\"size\":[x,y,z],\"radius\":r}  (r at most 0.4 x the smallest size)\n- {\"op\":\"cylinder\",\"radiusTop\":r1,\"radiusBottom\":r2,\"depth\":h,\"radialSegments\":32}  (axis along Y, height h)\n- {\"op\":\"sphere\",\"radius\":r}\n- {\"op\":\"torus\",\"radius\":R,\"tube\":t}  (ring lies in the XY plane; its axis is Z; outer diameter 2(R+t))\n- {\"op\":\"tube\",\"points\":[[x,y,z],...],\"radius\":r}  (swept circle through the points, relative to the component position)\nUse exactly the component ids the request names.",
 "protocol": {
  "models": [
   "haiku",
   "sonnet"
  ],
  "maxRounds": 3,
  "runsPerTask": 1,
  "note": "Fixed before any model call. No retries outside the loop; failures are kept."
 },
